{"content":[{"c":["MOLADAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the cities belonging to Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.26","r":"Josh.15.26","rawR":"Josh.15.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.26","value":"Josh.15.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:26"},"), later assigned to Simeon (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.2","r":"Josh.19.2","rawR":"Josh.19.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.2","value":"Josh.19.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.28","r":"1Chr.4.28","rawR":"1Chr.4.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.28","value":"1Chr.4.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:28"},"). The people of Judah resettled that area after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.26","r":"Neh.11.26","rawR":"Neh.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.26","value":"Neh.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Some consider Moladah identical to Malatha, which became an Idumean fortress occupied by the Edomites (Josephus’s ",{"c":["Antiquities"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," 18.6.2). Others place it by Jattir, at modern Khureibet el-Waten, as do Jerome and Eusebius. The evidence is, however, too obscure to make certain identification."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Moladah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.26","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.26","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.26"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.2","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.2","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.2"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.28","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.28","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.28"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.26","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.26","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a9550ce8608f5db995b6da02e660a4430717860c2dc4f4cfa0278f8bd38c68be","sourceItemName":"Moladah","sourceItemOrder":380,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Moladah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Moladah","title":"Moladah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}